{% comment %}
============================================================================
  CO-BRANDED PRODUCT SECTION — "Powered by Go-To Gifting"  (PRODUCTION)
============================================================================
  Purpose: Render a client-branded product page (e.g. Forever Rose) on the
  Go-To Gifting Shopify store. Go-To Gifting is the SELLER OF RECORD.
  The client is a MARKETING / AFFILIATE PARTNER only — they do not take the
  order or capture payment. Checkout routes through the standard Go-To
  Gifting cart/checkout, giving one unified checkout across all clients.

  HOW TO CLONE PER CLIENT (no code edits):
    1. Duplicate templates/product.cobrand.json as
       templates/product.cobrand-<client-handle>.json
    2. Change the section settings (name, logo, colors, menu, alcohol flag).
    3. In Shopify Admin, assign the client's products to that template.

  AFFILIATE ATTRIBUTION:
    Every add-to-cart stamps a hidden line item property `_Client` with the
    client brand name. It flows through to the order, so commission payouts
    can be calculated per client from order line items. (Underscore-prefixed
    properties are hidden from the customer in cart/checkout/emails.)

  ALCOHOL COMPLIANCE HOOKS (active when "Is alcohol product" is checked):
    1. Age-verification gate (21+) — buyer-level; blocks add-to-cart until
       confirmed. This is the only screening that belongs on the product page.
    2. Seller-of-record legal line naming Go-To Gifting + license number.

  DESTINATION-STATE ENFORCEMENT IS *NOT* DONE HERE — IT BELONGS AT CHECKOUT.
  Alcohol legality is governed by the SHIP-TO (destination) state, not the
  buyer's location. A buyer in a restricted state may lawfully send a gift
  to a permitted state, so the product page must NOT block by buyer
  location. Tag alcohol products and run a CART-SCOPED checkout validation
  (Shopify Functions / checkout app) that enforces the state list only when
  the cart contains a tagged alcohol item. Non-alcohol carts ship normally.

  >> Age gate + disclosure wording + license # require attorney sign-off, as
     does the destination state list used by the checkout-layer validation. <<
============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign client_name   = section.settings.client_name | default: 'Client Brand'
  assign seller_entity = section.settings.seller_entity | default: 'Go-To Gifting LLC'
  assign license_no    = section.settings.license_number
  assign is_alcohol    = section.settings.is_alcohol
  assign accent        = section.settings.accent_color
  assign nav_color     = section.settings.nav_color
  assign client_menu   = section.settings.client_menu
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
-%}

<style>
  .cb-section {
    --cb-accent: {{ accent }};
    --cb-nav: {{ nav_color }};
    --cb-ink: #2b2b2b;
    --cb-cream: {{ section.settings.buybox_color | default: '#faf6ee' }};
    --cb-atc: {{ section.settings.atc_color | default: '#36a546' }};
    --cb-line: #e7e0d2;
    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    color: var(--cb-ink);
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cb-brandbar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px; padding: 22px 16px 14px; position: relative;
  }
  .cb-logo img { max-height: 56px; width: auto; display: block; }
  .cb-wordmark {
    font-style: italic; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: .5px;
    color: var(--cb-accent); font-weight: 400;
  }
  .cb-wordmark sup { font-size: 11px; }
  /* The disclosure that keeps this honest — sits next to the brand name */
  .cb-poweredby {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.3; color: #6a6a6a;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--cb-line); padding-left: 14px;
  }
  .cb-poweredby strong { color: var(--cb-ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .cb-nav {
    background: var(--cb-nav); color: #fff; text-align: center;
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px; padding: 14px; letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
  .cb-nav a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; }
  .cb-nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .cb-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px;
    padding: 36px 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px){ .cb-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px; } }

  /* --- Gallery --- */
  .cb-gallery-main img { width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; display: block; }
  .cb-thumbs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cb-thumbs button {
    border: 1px solid var(--cb-line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0;
    background: none; cursor: pointer; width: 64px; height: 64px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cb-thumbs button.is-active { border-color: var(--cb-accent); }
  .cb-thumbs img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

  .cb-title { font-size: 30px; color: var(--cb-accent); margin: 0 0 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
  .cb-sku { color: #999; font-size: 13px; font-family: sans-serif; margin: 4px 0 18px; }
  .cb-buybox { background: var(--cb-cream); border-radius: 8px; padding: 22px; }
  .cb-stock { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; }
  .cb-stock.is-out { color: #a33; }
  .cb-ship { text-align: center; color: #2e8b57; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; margin: 4px 0; }
  .cb-price { text-align: center; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cb-accent); padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cb-price s { color:#999; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-left: 8px; }
  .cb-label { display:block; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .cb-field { width: 100%; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--cb-line); border-radius: 6px; background:#fff; font-family: sans-serif; font-size:15px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  textarea.cb-field { resize: vertical; min-height: 70px; }
  .cb-qty-row { display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; }
  .cb-qty-row input { width: 84px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--cb-line); border-radius: 6px; font-size:15px; }
  .cb-addcart {
    width: 100%; padding: 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--cb-atc); color: #fff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer; font-family: sans-serif; transition: filter .15s;
  }
  .cb-addcart:hover { filter: brightness(.95); }
  .cb-addcart:disabled { background: #b9b9b9; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .cb-securenote { text-align: center; color: var(--cb-accent); font-size: 13px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 12px; }
  .cb-desc { padding: 0 24px 36px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 820px; }
  .cb-desc h2 { color: var(--cb-accent); font-size: 22px; }

  /* --- Alcohol compliance UI --- */
  .cb-agegate {
    border: 1px solid #d8b4b4; background: #fcf3f3; border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;
  }
  .cb-agegate label { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; cursor:pointer; }
  .cb-legal {
    font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: #777; line-height: 1.5;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--cb-line); margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px;
  }
</style>

<div class="cb-section" data-is-alcohol="{{ is_alcohol }}">

  {%- comment -%} ===== Co-brand header with disclosure ===== {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="cb-brandbar">
    {%- if section.settings.client_logo != blank -%}
      <span class="cb-logo">
        {{ section.settings.client_logo | image_url: width: 360 | image_tag: alt: client_name }}
      </span>
    {%- elsif section.settings.client_logo_asset != blank -%}
      <span class="cb-logo">
        <img src="{{ section.settings.client_logo_asset | asset_url }}" alt="{{ client_name | escape }}">
      </span>
    {%- else -%}
      <span class="cb-wordmark">{{ client_name }}<sup>&reg;</sup></span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="cb-poweredby">
      powered by<br><strong>{{ seller_entity }}</strong>
    </span>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ===== Client nav — driven by a Shopify menu, per client ===== {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if client_menu != blank -%}
    <nav class="cb-nav">
      {%- for link in client_menu.links -%}
        <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </nav>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="cb-grid">

    {%- comment -%} ===== Gallery: full media set with thumbnails ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cb-gallery">
      <div class="cb-gallery-main">
        {%- if product.featured_media -%}
          <img id="cb-main-img"
               src="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 900 }}"
               alt="{{ product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}">
        {%- else -%}
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
        <div class="cb-thumbs">
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            <button type="button"
                    class="cb-thumb{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
                    data-full="{{ media | image_url: width: 900 }}"
                    aria-label="View image {{ forloop.index }}">
              <img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 128 }}" alt="{{ media.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ===== Buy box ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cb-buyside">
      <h1 class="cb-title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
      {%- if current_variant.sku != blank -%}
        <div class="cb-sku">{{ current_variant.sku }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="cb-buybox">
        <div class="cb-stock {% unless current_variant.available %}is-out{% endunless %}" id="cb-stock">
          {%- if current_variant.available -%}In Stock{%- else -%}Sold Out{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- if section.settings.shipping_line != blank -%}
          <div class="cb-ship">{{ section.settings.shipping_line }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="cb-price" id="cb-price">
          {{ current_variant.price | money }}
          {%- if current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price -%}
            <s>{{ current_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if is_alcohol -%}
        {%- comment -%} ===== Age gate (buyer-level — fine on product page) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="cb-agegate">
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" id="cb-age-confirm">
            <span>I confirm I am 21 years of age or older. A valid government ID
            and adult signature (21+) are required on delivery.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        {%- comment -%}
          NO destination-state dropdown here by design — see header comment.
          Destination eligibility is enforced at checkout, cart-scoped.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ===== Real product form → /cart/add ===== {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- form 'product', product, id: 'cb-product-form' -%}

          {%- comment -%} Variant selector (real variants, price-aware) {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if product.variants.size > 1 -%}
            <label class="cb-label" for="cb-variant">
              {{ product.options | join: ' / ' }}
            </label>
            <select class="cb-field" id="cb-variant" name="id">
              {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                <option value="{{ variant.id }}"
                        data-price="{{ variant.price | money }}"
                        data-compare="{% if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price %}{{ variant.compare_at_price | money }}{% endif %}"
                        data-available="{{ variant.available }}"
                        data-sku="{{ variant.sku | escape }}"
                        {% if variant == current_variant %}selected{% endif %}
                        {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                  {{ variant.title }} — {{ variant.price | money }}{% unless variant.available %} (sold out){% endunless %}
                </option>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </select>
          {%- else -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}">
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.show_engraving -%}
            <label class="cb-label" for="cb-engrave">{{ section.settings.engraving_label }}</label>
            <input type="text" class="cb-field" id="cb-engrave"
                   name="properties[Engraving]" maxlength="30"
                   placeholder="Message Here (30 Character Max)">
            {%- if section.settings.engraving_note != blank -%}
              <p style="font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#777;margin:-6px 0 12px;">{{ section.settings.engraving_note }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.show_gift_message -%}
            <label class="cb-label" for="cb-gift-msg">Gift message (optional)</label>
            <textarea class="cb-field" id="cb-gift-msg"
                      name="properties[Gift Message]" maxlength="300"
                      placeholder="Write a note to go with this gift&hellip;"></textarea>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%} Affiliate attribution — hidden from customer, lands on the order {%- endcomment -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="properties[_Client]" value="{{ client_name | escape }}">

          <div class="cb-qty-row">
            <label class="cb-label" for="cb-qty" style="margin:0">Qty</label>
            <input type="number" id="cb-qty" name="quantity" value="1" min="1">
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="cb-addcart" id="cb-addcart"
                  {% if is_alcohol %}disabled{% endif %}
                  {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
            {%- if current_variant.available -%}Add to Cart{%- else -%}Sold Out{%- endif -%}
          </button>
        {%- endform -%}

        <div class="cb-securenote">Fast, Safe &amp; Secure Checkout. Satisfaction Guaranteed.</div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ===== Seller-of-record legal line ===== {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cb-legal">
        Sold by <strong>{{ seller_entity }}</strong>{% if license_no != blank %}, CA ABC License #{{ license_no }}{% endif %}.
        {{ client_name }} is a marketing partner and is not the seller of record.
        {%- if is_alcohol %} Alcohol sales are limited to eligible states and to
        adults 21 or older; ID and adult signature required at delivery.
        Void where prohibited.{% endif %}
        {%- comment -%} ATTORNEY: confirm exact wording, license #, and state list. {%- endcomment -%}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if product.description != blank -%}
    <div class="cb-desc">
      <h2>About this gift</h2>
      {{ product.description }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<script>
  (function(){
    var form  = document.getElementById('cb-product-form');
    var btn   = document.getElementById('cb-addcart');
    if (!form || !btn) return;

    var sel    = document.getElementById('cb-variant');
    var price  = document.getElementById('cb-price');
    var stock  = document.getElementById('cb-stock');
    var sku    = document.querySelector('.cb-sku');
    var age    = document.getElementById('cb-age-confirm');
    var isAlc  = {{ is_alcohol | json }};

    function variantAvailable(){
      if (!sel) return {{ current_variant.available | json }};
      var opt = sel.options[sel.selectedIndex];
      return opt && opt.dataset.available === 'true';
    }
    function refreshButton(){
      var ok = variantAvailable() && (!isAlc || (age && age.checked));
      btn.disabled = !ok;
      btn.textContent = variantAvailable() ? 'Add to Cart' : 'Sold Out';
    }
    if (sel) sel.addEventListener('change', function(){
      var opt = sel.options[sel.selectedIndex];
      if (price) price.innerHTML = opt.dataset.price + (opt.dataset.compare ? ' <s>' + opt.dataset.compare + '</s>' : '');
      if (stock) {
        stock.textContent = opt.dataset.available === 'true' ? 'In Stock' : 'Sold Out';
        stock.classList.toggle('is-out', opt.dataset.available !== 'true');
      }
      if (sku && opt.dataset.sku) sku.textContent = opt.dataset.sku;
      refreshButton();
    });
    if (age) age.addEventListener('change', refreshButton);
    refreshButton();

    // Image gallery thumbnails
    var mainImg = document.getElementById('cb-main-img');
    document.querySelectorAll('.cb-thumb').forEach(function(t){
      t.addEventListener('click', function(){
        if (mainImg) mainImg.src = t.dataset.full;
        document.querySelectorAll('.cb-thumb').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.remove('is-active'); });
        t.classList.add('is-active');
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Co-Brand Product",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Co-Branding"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "client_name",
      "label": "Client brand name",
      "default": "Forever Rose"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "client_logo",
      "label": "Client logo",
      "info": "Shown in place of the text wordmark when set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "client_logo_asset",
      "label": "Client logo asset filename",
      "info": "Fallback: a file in the theme's assets folder (e.g. cobrand-forever-rose-logo.png). Used when no logo image is picked above."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "seller_entity",
      "label": "Seller of record (your licensed entity)",
      "default": "Go-To Gifting LLC"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "license_number",
      "label": "CA ABC license # (Type 21)",
      "info": "Confirm with attorney before publishing."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Brand accent (wordmark)",
      "default": "#b8860b"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "nav_color",
      "label": "Nav bar color",
      "default": "#002850"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "client_menu",
      "label": "Client navigation menu",
      "info": "Build a menu per client in Online Store \u2192 Navigation, then pick it here. Hidden if unset."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Buy Box"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "shipping_line",
      "label": "Shipping line",
      "default": "Ships in 1\u20132 business days",
      "info": "Keep this honest \u2014 it shows under the stock status."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "buybox_color",
      "label": "Buy box background",
      "default": "#faf6ee"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "atc_color",
      "label": "Add to Cart button color",
      "default": "#36a546"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_engraving",
      "label": "Show engraving field",
      "default": false,
      "info": "Adds a 30-character personalization line (saved as an 'Engraving' property on the order). Price the engraving via a product option/variant \u2014 this field doesn't charge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "engraving_label",
      "label": "Engraving field label",
      "default": "Hand Engrave Your Rose"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "engraving_note",
      "label": "Engraving note",
      "default": "Engraved items are not returnable. Engraving is done by hand in all caps; it is very light."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_gift_message",
      "label": "Show gift message field",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Alcohol Compliance"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "is_alcohol",
      "label": "Is alcohol product",
      "default": false,
      "info": "Enables 21+ age gate and the alcohol seller-of-record disclosure. Destination-state eligibility is enforced at CHECKOUT (cart-scoped validation), not on this page."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Ship-to state eligibility is NOT set here. Tag alcohol products and enforce the attorney-approved state list at checkout via a cart-scoped validation (Shopify Functions / checkout app) so non-alcohol gifts still ship freely."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Co-Brand Product"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
